# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in.
# YouTube Data API v3 key: resolves playlists, filters out videos that can't be
# embedded, builds queues from single-video / radio links, and enables search.
# Without it, real playlists (PL…) and single videos still work; search does not.
# This key ships to the browser: restrict it in Google Cloud Console to
#   Application restrictions → HTTP referrers (your site + http://127.0.0.1:5173/*)
#   API restrictions → YouTube Data API v3 only
VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
